### Creation BC — 提示词辅助(POST /v1/prompt-assist,p9_05)
###
### 移动端「增强提示词」/「扩写提示词」按钮通用入口.
### 经 capability.Invoke(SurfaceInternal) 走 14-step middleware chain.
###
### 文档:
###   - 完整方案: docs/plan/提示词辅助_完整实施方案_v2.md
###   - API 段:   docs/api/creation.md §提示词辅助 (POST /v1/prompt-assist, p9_05)
###   - Seed:    docs/migrations/p9_04_prompt_assist_templates.sql + p9_05_prompt_assist_capability.sql
###
### env 变量:see docs/api/http-requests/http-client.env.json
###   - {{base_url}}     e.g. http://localhost:8080
###   - {{access_token}} JWT (含非空 BID claim)
###   - {{app_id}} + {{app_signature}}  see cmd/signtool
###
### 红线:
###   - 严禁在 body 传 account_id / app_id / tenant_id — 由 ctx middleware 注入,body 会被忽略
###   - mode 仅 "enhance" / "expand" — Handler / Schema / Executor 三道防御
###   - 客户端不直接调 /v1/capabilities/prompt_assist/invoke (admin gated 返 40300)

############################################
# 1. 增强提示词 (enhance)
# 200 OK — { data: { result_text, mode, language, model_used, cost_credits, cache_hit } }
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": "画一张冬天的猫",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "scene_hint": "image_generation",
  "idempotency_key": "demo-enhance-{{$timestamp}}"
}

############################################
# 2. 扩写提示词 (expand)
# 输出长度通常为输入 2-4 倍, 补充细节 / 场景 / 风格.
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "expand",
  "text": "一只可爱的猫",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "idempotency_key": "demo-expand-{{$timestamp}}"
}

############################################
# 3. Cache 命中验证 — 同 idempotency_key + 同 input 再调
# 期望:
#   data.cache_hit = true
#   data.cost_credits = 0  (cache 命中不计费)
#   ~10ms 返回
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": "画一张冬天的猫",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "scene_hint": "image_generation",
  "idempotency_key": "demo-enhance-cache-fixed-001"
}

############################################
# 4. 客户端 model_hint 覆盖 config 默认
# Executor 优先级: input.model_hint > config.prompt_assist.default_model_version_bid
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": "短文本",
  "model_hint": "<your-gemini-flash-model-version-bid>",
  "idempotency_key": "demo-modelhint-{{$timestamp}}"
}

############################################
# 5. mode 非法 → 40030 (Handler 第一道防御)
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "delete",
  "text": "hi"
}

############################################
# 6. text 空 → 40030
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": ""
}

############################################
# 7. body 中的 account_id / tenant_id 被忽略 (越权防御 — 仅信 ctx middleware)
# 即使 body 含 account_id=999999, 实际计费走 JWT 注入的 account_id.
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": "x",
  "account_id": 999999,
  "tenant_id": 888888,
  "surface_kind": "direct_api"
}

############################################
# 8. 缺 Authorization → 40103 unauthorized
############################################

POST {{base_url}}/v1/prompt-assist
X-App-ID: {{app_id}}
X-App-Signature: {{app_signature}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "enhance",
  "text": "x"
}
